# Patterns excluded when this chart is loaded/packaged.
#
# nodepool/ is documentation only — the out-of-band Kata MNG recipe it described is
# superseded by the kata-nodepool addon (self-managed Karpenter EC2NodeClass +
# NodePool). Its README is kept in git because kata-nodepool/README.md links to it,
# but it is not part of this chart's output. The dead kata-mng.tf / eksctl / .mime
# files were removed outright.
nodepool/
#
# upstream/ is intentionally NOT ignored. It is a chart in its own right (it has its
# own Chart.yaml) and is deployed as a SEPARATE Application from the registry path
# gitops/addons/charts/agent-sandbox/upstream. Ignore patterns apply relative to the
# chart root being loaded, so this file does not affect that app either way — but
# leaving upstream/ present keeps the directory self-describing.
.git/
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig
*~
*.tgz
